      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe I\u0027m missing something but why do we need to do the static cast to the base type here and why can\u0027t GetLabel be called in `CaptureSetLabel` (either on the CaptureContext or the Device)?\n\nRemoving both would make the function\u0027s body even simple and IMHO remove the need to have a macro for this.",
